{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55608","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"达来何处更追寻，放旷谁论古与今。\n风带泉声流谷口，云和山影落潭心。\n资身自有衣中宝，济世谁藏室内金。\n策杖偶来林下坐，鸟声相和唱圆音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}